quickjs-ng (vendored, unmodified)
=================================

Upstream : https://github.com/quickjs-ng/quickjs
Version  : v0.17.0 (tag archive https://github.com/quickjs-ng/quickjs/archive/refs/tags/v0.17.0.tar.gz)
Licence  : MIT (see LICENSE)

Only the files the engine needs are vendored: quickjs.c, dtoa.c, libregexp.c, libunicode.c and the
headers they include. quickjs-libc (std/os modules), the qjs CLI, tests and fuzzers are intentionally
NOT included: extensions must not get file or process access.

To update: replace the files from a newer upstream tag, update the version above, rebuild and run
`ctest` (tst_quickjs verifies async/await and promise jobs still work).
